content:
{title: Ger Odi E Lwanda}

{comment: Verse 1}
Ger odi e lwanda,
Kata apaka bire yembe joyiengo,
Ok nipodhi  adier
Ok nipodhi  adier

{comment: Verse 2}
Ger odi e kite,
We weche mathoth elwet Ruoth Nyasaye,
Ok nipodhi adier
Ok nipodhi adier

{comment: Verse 3}
Ger odi e lwanda,
We paro gik maricho e chunyi;
Chunyu en od Ruoth
Chunyu en od Ruoth

{comment: Verse 4}
Ka igedo e kwoyo,
Ka Yesu biro limo odino;
To nomuk odno
To nomuk odno

{comment: Verse 5}
Wach weche mangima,
Ema kit Nyasaye nosingo chutho;
Ema wasiku oluoro
Ema wasiku oluoro

{comment: Verse 6}
Wer wende mangima,
Gin chiembe chuny mabiro mao e polo;
Ema wasigu oluoro
Ema wasigu oluoro
